File Exchange Interface (FEI) Version 5 Client Software Distribution
Jet Propulsion Laboratory, Mission Data Management Service (MDMS)
Created @TIMESTAMP@

Documentation is available in the doc/ directory:

  doc/installation.md                    Installation guide
  doc/users-guide.md                     User's guide (commands and operations)
  doc/appendix-a-command-reference.md    Complete command reference
  doc/appendix-b-troubleshooting.md      Troubleshooting guide

PLEASE NOTE that FEI requires OpenJDK 1.8 or higher (Java 8+).
Download Java from https://adoptium.net/ or https://openjdk.org/

For questions, bug reports, or feature requests, please open an issue on GitHub:
https://github.com/nasa-jpl/fei-client/issues
